"""Build a self-contained offline Canvas 3D preview from the final handoff JSON.

Usage: python3 build_preview.py [--input planning_result.json]
                              [--output planning_preview.html]
No browser, network, JavaScript package, or Python package is required to build.
The full supplied JSON is embedded, including all polygon rings and components.
"""
